section.environment-approaches(class="relative section-py z-2")
    .container
        .section-wrapper(class="flex-center flex-col gap-6")
            .section-heading
                h2.heading
                    .text(class="heading-1-subpage text-primary-4 text-center font-bold")
                        | OUR APPROACHES

            .section-desc
                p.desc
                    .text(class="body-1 text-Utility-gray-950 font-primary")
                        | At Bel Ga Asia, we transform our sustainability commitments into measurable actions. Through clear goals, continuous performance monitoring, stakeholder collaboration, and innovation, we drive responsible growth and create lasting value for our customers, communities, and the environment.

            .section-content
                .grid
                    -for(i=0;i<4;i++)
                        .item-container
                            .item-content(class="flex-center flex-col gap-4 md:gap-5 w-full h-full")
                                .item-img(class="w-[34.48%]")
                                    .img(class="img-ratio aspect-square")
                                        +PugImg()

                                .item-text(class="flex-center flex-col flex-1 gap-3")
                                    .text-title
                                        h3.title
                                            .text(class="heading-4 text-primary-1 font-bold")
                                                | Environmental Stewardship

                                    .text-desc(class="flex-1")
                                        p.desc
                                            .text(class="body-2 text-Utility-gray-950 text-justify")
                                                | We are committed to delivering consistent superior quality Day Old Chicks and Day Old Layers across Asia.